<p>This page explains how ARM models SAP roles.</p>
<ac:structured-macro ac:name="toc" ac:schema-version="1" ac:macro-id="0b1c2d3e" />
<h1>Roles</h1>
<p>A role bundles authorizations. Users are assigned through the <code>AGR_USERS</code>&nbsp;table.</p>
<h2>Single roles</h2>
<ul>
  <li><p>Hold authorization objects such as <strong>S_TCODE</strong>.</p></li>
  <li><p>Are assigned directly</p>
    <ol>
      <li><p>via PFCG</p></li>
      <li><p>via SU01</p></li>
    </ol>
  </li>
</ul>
<h2>Composite roles</h2>
<p>A composite role contains single roles.</p>
<ac:structured-macro ac:name="code" ac:schema-version="1" ac:macro-id="7f8e9d0c">
  <ac:parameter ac:name="language">sql</ac:parameter>
  <ac:parameter ac:name="title">Role assignments</ac:parameter>
  <ac:plain-text-body><![CDATA[SELECT agr_name, uname
  FROM agr_users
 WHERE agr_name LIKE 'Z%';]]></ac:plain-text-body>
</ac:structured-macro>
